            "anchor": "native_silver",
            "text": "Native Silver is an ore of $(thing)Silver$() metal. Small poor veins can be found in $(thing)Granite$() or $(thing)Diorite$() in uplift regions, above y=90. Larger and richer veins can be found in $(thing)Granite$(), $(thing)Diorite$(), $(thing)Schist$(), and $(thing)Gneiss$() deep underground below y=20.$(br2)It can also be found in deposits in $(thing)rivers$(), which can be $(l:mechanics/panning)panned$().",
